    <section class="card anchor" id="price-match" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px">Already have quotes? Get a free price match check</h2>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 12px">
        Send your basic info and I’ll compare a 0% escalator Solar PPA option to what you were offered.
        (No spam — just a straight comparison.)
